sequenceDiagram
    actor A as User A
    participant C as Console / Copilot
    participant E as Entra ID
    participant M as MCP server
    participant S as Azure AI Search
    A->>C: Question
    C->>E: Request token for api://mcp/access_as_user
    E-->>C: Access token (aud = MCP)
    C->>M: search(query) + token
    M->>M: Validate audience, issuer and authorized client
    M->>E: OBO: user token + federated client assertion
    E-->>M: Search token on behalf of User A
    M->>S: Query + app token + delegated user token
    S-->>M: Documents filtered by group
    M-->>C: Results + links
